    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Danger Crew is a retro-style RPG about being a programmer at a company.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064690/extras/90f03b709ccc36125d467157a4e37d60.poster.avif?t=1589645170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064690/extras/90f03b709ccc36125d467157a4e37d60.webm?t=1589645170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064690/extras/90f03b709ccc36125d467157a4e37d60.mp4?t=1589645170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>In Danger Crew, you will:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bust out your laptop in hack battles against other programmers<br></li><li>Level up your Crew with new scripts, laptop upgrades, and computer science themed items<br></li><li>Complete journal quests by helping people at the office and in the city solve big problems<br></li><li>A full 7 chapter single player story experience<br></li><li>Original soundtrack created by the developers and friends</li></ul><br><strong>What's the gameplay like?</strong><br>A mashup of Earthbound, Super Mario RPG, and Pokemon.<br><br><strong>How long does Danger Crew take to complete?</strong><br>On average, people finish the story in 6-7 hours.<br><br><strong>Reviewers and Streamers say:</strong><br><br>\u201cDanger Crew has to be one of the more refreshing takes on an old school genre I've played in quite some time.\u201d - PiroTae<br><br>\u201cthe graphical style is a nostalgic homage to quirky Super Nintendo RPGs like Earthbound &amp; Robotrek\u201c - devon.dale1<br><br>\u201cIf you like charming games like Stardew Valley, then you will enjoy this one as well!\u201d - Rummy",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Danger Crew is a retro-style RPG about being a programmer at a company.</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064690/extras/90f03b709ccc36125d467157a4e37d60.poster.avif?t=1589645170\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064690/extras/90f03b709ccc36125d467157a4e37d60.webm?t=1589645170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1064690/extras/90f03b709ccc36125d467157a4e37d60.mp4?t=1589645170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>In Danger Crew, you will:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Bust out your laptop in hack battles against other programmers<br></li><li>Level up your Crew with new scripts, laptop upgrades, and computer science themed items<br></li><li>Complete journal quests by helping people at the office and in the city solve big problems<br></li><li>A full 7 chapter single player story experience<br></li><li>Original soundtrack created by the developers and friends</li></ul><br><strong>What's the gameplay like?</strong><br>A mashup of Earthbound, Super Mario RPG, and Pokemon.<br><br><strong>How long does Danger Crew take to complete?</strong><br>On average, people finish the story in 6-7 hours.<br><br><strong>Reviewers and Streamers say:</strong><br><br>\u201cDanger Crew has to be one of the more refreshing takes on an old school genre I've played in quite some time.\u201d - PiroTae<br><br>\u201cthe graphical style is a nostalgic homage to quirky Super Nintendo RPGs like Earthbound &amp; Robotrek\u201c - devon.dale1<br><br>\u201cIf you like charming games like Stardew Valley, then you will enjoy this one as well!\u201d - Rummy",
    "short_description": "Danger Crew is a single-player, retro-style RPG set in a world where programmers battle using laptops. Fire computer commands in Hack Battles until your enemies' laptops explode in a smoking cloud of defeat. Build your crew to be the most unstoppable programming team the world has ever seen.",
